{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:39:44+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:39:44+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Allianz SE","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Diversified","country":"Germany","city":"Munich","website":"https://www.allianz.com","employees":138378,"summary":"Allianz SE, together with its subsidiaries, provides property-casualty insurance, life/health insurance, and asset management products and services worldwide. The company's Property-Casualty segment offers various insurance products, including motor liability, accident, fire and property, general liability, credit, and travel, and assistance services to private and corporate customers. Its Life/Health segment provides a range of life and health insurance products on an individual and a group basis, such as annuities, endowment and term insurance, and unit-linked and investment-oriented products, as well as private and supplemental health, and long-term care insurance products. The company's Asset Management segment offers institutional and retail asset management products and services to third-party investors comprising equity and fixed income funds, cash, and multi-assets; and alternative investment products that include real estate, infrastructure debt/equity, real assets, liquid alternatives, and solutions business. In addition, it provides banking services for retail clients; and digital investment services. Allianz SE was founded in 1890 and is headquartered in Munich, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Allianz SE, avec ses filiales, fournit des produits et services d'assurance de dommages, d'assurance vie / santé et de gestion d'actifs dans le monde entier. Le segment Propriété-Casualty de la société offre divers produits d'assurance, notamment des services de responsabilité civile automobile, d'accident, d'incendie et de propriété, de responsabilité générale, de crédit et de voyage, ainsi que des services d'assistance aux clients privés et aux entreprises. Son secteur Vie/Santé fournit une gamme de produits d'assurance vie et santé, tant sur une base individuelle que de groupe, tels que les rentes, les assurances de dotation et d'assurance temporaire, les produits liés à des unités et axés sur les investissements, ainsi que les produits d'assurance santé privée et complémentaire et les produits d'assurance de soins de longue durée."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":165672239104,"shares_outstanding":379286270,"trailing_pe":14.492369,"forward_pe":13.084652,"price_to_book":2.6261046,"ev_to_ebitda":3.096,"ev_to_revenue":0.557,"dividend_yield":0.0396,"payout_ratio":0.5607,"beta_yahoo":0.688},"targets":{"current_price":436.8,"mean":447.89078,"median":445.0,"high":684.0,"low":353.0,"n_analysts":16,"reco_mean":2.70588,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-12"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-08","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":8.9999994e-05,"institutions_pct":0.43221,"institutions_float_pct":0.43225,"institutions_n":936,"institutions":[{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.0001,"shares":24168,"value":10556582,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Meyer Handelman Co","pct":0.0,"shares":599,"value":261643,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":1.0},{"name":"Paradigm Asset Management Company, LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":3200,"value":1397759,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":4730,"value":2066063,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0119},{"name":"Gamma Investing LLC","pct":0.0,"shares":130,"value":56783,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0147,"shares":5592433,"value":2442774666,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0039},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUN